	<entry>
		<title>From Battlefield to Sports Ground</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/2-from-battlefield-to-sports-ground"/>
		<published>2016-10-21T09:28:53+00:00</published>
		<updated>2016-10-21T09:28:53+00:00</updated>
		<id>http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/2-from-battlefield-to-sports-ground</id>
		<author>
			<name>Super User</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;One day in September 1951 in the midst of the Korean war (1950-1953) President Kim Il Sung was briefed in the operation room of the Supreme Command that the delegation returned home from the World Youth and Students Festival. Quite satisfied at the news he highly appreciated the sportsmen for their success in the festival.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Then he thought something for a moment and told officials to form a sports team in the Korean People’s Army in an enthusiastic tone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The officials were surprised. In the thick of war decisive to the destiny of the nation it was inconceivable to organize a sports team with the people’s army men.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Looking at them standing aghast, he said that there was no reason to desist from engaging in sports activities in wartime and stressed that he had already thought it over when he sent the sports delegation to Berlin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;He told the excited officials that they might think there is something out of the way about organizing a sports team in the KPA amidst the war, but how can they win the war without that much composure in the heart and assured them that now the score of the war had already been decided practically and the selection of a hundred sportsmen would not change the situation in the front.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;December 15, 1951 three months later, the Supreme Commander gave the order of organizing the KPA sports team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;His steel-strong will and courage and clairvoyant wisdom produced a story of soldiers summoned from the fierce battlefield to the sports drill ground yet unknown in the war history.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
