		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;One winter day in 1964 when the great leader Comrade Kim Jong Il (1942-2011) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;was &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;working in the Central Committee of the Workers’ Party of Korea&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;called an official to ask a way of solving the traffic problem in the city.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The official suggested after some pondering to give a week’s time to consider a plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The leader saw him for a while and said to accompany him to go to the teachers at 8 in the evening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;In the evening he got on a city-run bus with the official to listen to the opinions of the citizens and went to the bus station to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;hear from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt; bus repairmen &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;what they say&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt; and then he came back to the office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Next dawn &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;he called &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;the official and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;gave him&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt; a plan of some measures to cope up with the traffic problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The official was astonished seeing the plan because &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;it &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;contained what they heard from the citizens in the bus and the repairmen in the station.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;He noted that his plan was &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;a mere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt; arrangement of what they heard from the mentors and added that his most adored mentors &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;were&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt; those they had met last evening.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
