	<entry>
		<title>His Pleasure</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/4-his-pleasure"/>
		<published>2016-10-21T09:30:11+00:00</published>
		<updated>2016-10-21T09:30:11+00:00</updated>
		<id>http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/4-his-pleasure</id>
		<author>
			<name>Super User</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Last April respected Marshal &lt;strong&gt;Kim Jong Un&lt;/strong&gt; inspected the Mindulle Notebook Factory modernized before the 7th Congress of the WPK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The factory has been built thanks to the solicitude of the Marshal who is devoting his all to opening up a bright future of children and students with boundless noble affection for them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Seeing round the factory, he said quite satisfied that he was very much pleased to think the children to be glad with quality notebooks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The officials accompanying him were greatly moved when they saw him naming the factory as the Mindulle Notebook Factory and giving meticulous instructions on the issues arising in the increase of production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Saying that notebooks was a matter President &lt;strong&gt;Kim I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Sung &lt;/strong&gt;and leader &lt;strong&gt;Kim Jong &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;had been directing great attention in their lifetime, he was very satisfied that their another behest could be fulfilled with this factory built.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;He told that since the WPK attaches great importance to it, the factory had to increase the production of quality notebooks with motherly affection of making notebooks for their own children.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Saying that the whirring of the factory’s normal production seems children’s chorusing of the song “We Are the Happiest in the World”, he emphasized that a moment’s letup should not be allowed here in production for the sake of their delight and happiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Indeed, the laughter of the children and their singing the song “We Are the Happiest in the World” give the respected Marshal the greatest happiness and pleasure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;With the story of the love for the rising generation and the future the factory runs full steam ahead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
