	<entry>
		<title>New But Old Clothes</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/5-new-but-old-clothes"/>
		<published>2016-10-21T09:30:44+00:00</published>
		<updated>2016-10-21T09:30:44+00:00</updated>
		<id>http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/5-new-but-old-clothes</id>
		<author>
			<name>Super User</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The officials made a new suit with quality cloth for President &lt;strong&gt;Kim I&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt; Sung&lt;/strong&gt; in mid-August, 1984.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Facing his surprised look, one of them answered that his clothes were so discolored that they made a new suit and appealed him to take the new one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Then he said: I fully understand you. But I will take this new suit when all our people can take a dress or a suit made of this kind of quality cloth. If my present clothes look discolored, then turn them the inside out.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;They had no choice but to tailor a suit with the old clothes inside out as he had told.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;He was quite satisfied with the new suit made from his old clothes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Some days later the officials accompanying him on his way to the local places for on-the-spot guidance were delighted to see him in a new suit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;However, the one who knew how the “new clothes” had been made calmly wept.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
