&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;He was shown to a general playground when the children were intent on playing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;With a broad smile he looked for a while the children playing, and glanced some playingdoctors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;A baby doctor in a white smock was fairly making an examination with a stethoscope on the chest of a baby doll.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;With a loving look to their playing he approached to the baby doctor and told tenderly to the child to examine his pulse and blood pressure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The doctor pleased bent her head unaware of the words unfamiliar to her.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Then he asked to the teachers what words were the suitable to them in the circumstance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;As a teacher told him “You have to ask her to make an examination”, he asked the doctor:  Will you kindly examine me? Only then she asked him at ease with a stethoscope what his trouble was.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;The question of the loving child quite pleased him. He asked back to the child whether he was healthy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;He told to the officials accompanying him and teachers that the child was quite free with her equals in age, but now felt something different around, and took her in his embrace. It is a vivid view resembling a happy family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
		<category term="Anecdotes of Greate Men" />
	</entry>
