		<title>Courage and Grit of Great Man</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/7-courage-and-grit-of-great-man"/>
		<published>2016-10-21T09:32:18+00:00</published>
		<updated>2016-10-21T09:32:18+00:00</updated>
		<id>http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/7-courage-and-grit-of-great-man</id>
		<author>
			<name>Super User</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Leader &lt;strong&gt;Kim Jong Un&lt;/strong&gt; of the Democratic People’s Republic of Korea is possessed of courage and grit that shakes the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;His inspection of Panmunjom, the extremely hot spot in the Korean peninsula, on the MDL, in March, 2012 was a salient demonstration of his courage and grit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was beyond imagination for him to appear in a bright daytime in the midst of Panmunjom replete with the latest US war equipment and under the round-the-clock supervision by super-precision monitoring devices. Faced with the mettle shown by him seeing the south with a serious look taking a pair of binoculars in his hand on the balcony of the Panmun Pavilion, the US and south Korean troops trembled.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More startling was the fact that he summoned even military police officers on duty to have a photograph taken with them. Officials were anxious at the moment. He eased their anxiety, saying that the Supreme Commander came here today, who dare to go at. Today the Supreme Commander will defend Panmunjom, so take it easy, and you have to call all the officers on duty.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is impossible with an ordinary heart. South Korean media reported “It seemed a bolt from the blue,” and “We seemed to see the White House and Chongwadae suddenly dismantled”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Another occasion of witnessing his courage and grit was the first conference of the KPA pilots held in Pyongyang in April, 2014. The time was coincided with the culmination of the US-south Korea combined aerial exercise. He said in the conference that the convening of the conference itself with all the pilots of the army in Pyongyang present and our territorial air opened at a critical situation created by imperialists’ swarms of aircraft in the southern sky of the Korean peninsula is a victory of our courage, grit and mettle and a clear proof that the mentality of our heroic pilots overwhelms the enemy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was the height of the courage and grit never seen in any biography of great commanders. The world admires for his mettle and courage to face the nuclear and missile attack of the US with the righteous nuclear and missile attack and that if the US is to turn the Korean peninsula to a nuclear war theatre, he would submerge the entire US mainland, a lair of evils, in a deluge of fire.&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
