	<entry>
		<title>Admiration of Alan Garcia</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/8-admiration-of-alan-garcia"/>
		<published>2016-10-21T09:32:55+00:00</published>
		<updated>2016-10-21T09:32:55+00:00</updated>
		<id>http://koreanfriendship.org/anecdotes-of-greate-men/8-admiration-of-alan-garcia</id>
		<author>
			<name>Super User</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Alan Garcia, Secretary General of the National Executive Committee of the America Popular Revolutionary Alliance of Peru paid a visit to Korea in June, 1983.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;President &lt;strong&gt;Kim I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt; Sung&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12.16px;&quot;&gt;met him 6 times in 3 days and gave valuable instructions in the independence of Peru from the subjugation of the US.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the interview of July the first he explained one by one in detail about the necessity of keeping to independence in the revolution and construction, how he created the Juche idea, the principles to be held consistently in the building of a new society and all the issues for the global independence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He said: One must not swallow a foreign thing whole, no matter how good it is, he must accept it if the “stomach” accepts it, but if it does not, he must spit it out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alan Garcia was greatly impressed by his clear explanation with humorous and conventional figure of speech. He said:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; “What Your Excellency said is really a valuable remark. It can be said only by Your Excellency who put the ideal of mankind into reality.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The President said that if there is an inevitable formula in making revolution it must be that one must think everything with his own head and deal with it by himself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alan Garcia straightened himself and said respectfully:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“I will keep it in mind. As the revolutionary formula defined, I will do my best to do everything in Peruvian style to conform to the realities of Peru. We have met for the first time such a great leader as Your Excellency President. We will respect Y.E President as our mentor and learn from your idea.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Afterwards, he made active efforts to bring the independent aspiration and demand of the Peruvian people into effect under the slogan “Everything in Peruvian style to conform the Peruvian realities!”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</summary>
